    <worksheet name='Metrics by B2B pickups distance (V1)'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>Distance from Previous Pickup to Back-to-Back Pickup (m) </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>gv-md </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>[V1]</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>*The Previous Pickup is defined by the pickup location of the delivery notified immediately before the back-to-back order. This approach leads to considering stacked deliveries as the previous pickup.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>**&apos;Distance between pickups&apos; is Null in cases where the previous order or the b2b order were cancelled before pickup</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/B2Bpickupclosetopreviouspickup/MetricsbyB2Bpickupsdistance?rev=' id='MetricsbyB2Bpickupsdistance' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/B2Bpickupclosetopreviouspickup' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
